+# Proposal: Native distribution inventory and generators
+
+Compass currently exports portable skills and MCP fragments, but native Codex,
+Claude Code, and OpenCode distribution metadata is not owned by one versioned
+contract. Add a canonical inventory and deterministic generators so every
+harness receives complete, portable, version-recorded packages.
+
+This is additive. Existing `compass install`, skill locations, and generic
+Agent Skills exports remain compatible.
